    "faq_CBfhyg": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "object_QiNmNp": {
          "type": "object",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the Qure Micro-Infusion System?",
            "text": "<p>The Qure Micro-Infusion System is a skincare device that combines micro-needling with a special serum to rejuvenate your skin, helping to reduce the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, dark spots, and improve overall skin brightness and plumpness.</p>",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "object_4yYPQ4": {
          "type": "object",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the Qure Micro-Infusion System work?",
            "text": "<p>It uses 0.5mm 24k gold needles to create microchannels in the skin, allowing our science-backed Rejuvenating Serum to penetrate deeply and be more effective. This process stimulates the skin's natural recovery, promoting a youthful appearance.</p>",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "object_faRVVk": {
          "type": "object",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the Qure Micro-Infusion System safe to use?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the system has been tested and reviewed by leading dermatologists and is designed to be sterile and hygienic with minimal downtime, making it a safe option for at-home skin treatment.</p>",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "object_7ViJwh": {
          "type": "object",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How often should I use the Qure Micro-Infusion System?",
            "text": "<p>For best results, we recommend a 10-minute treatment every 2 weeks.</p>",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "object_tERiWN": {
          "type": "object",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use the Qure Micro-Infusion System if I have sensitive skin?",
            "text": "<p>While the system is designed to be gentle and has been loved by dermatologists, we recommend checking with a healthcare professional if you have concerns about using it on sensitive skin.</p>",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "object_b4xRkF": {
          "type": "object",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the benefits of using the Qure Micro-Infusion System?",
            "text": "<p>Benefits include fading the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, reducing dark spots and scarring, plumping and brightening dull skin, and activating the body's natural anti-aging mechanisms.</p>",
            "code": ""
